Use these as simple POC templates.

Backend env example
Place in .env.example (or copy to .env for local run):

DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://username:password@host:5432/scm_procurement
SECRET_KEY=replace-with-a-long-random-secret
CORS_ORIGINS=https://your-frontend.azurewebsites.net,https://your-staticapp.azurestaticapps.net

Optional integrations
AZURE_SIGNALR_ENDPOINT=
AZURE_SIGNALR_HUB=procurementchat
AZURE_SIGNALR_ACCESS_KEY=
ACS_CONNECTION_STRING=
MONGO_URI=
MONGO_DB=

Frontend env example
Place in .env.example (or copy to .env for local run):

VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.azurewebsites.net
VITE_API_TIMEOUT=30000

VITE_AUTH_TOKEN_KEY=pai_access_token
VITE_AUTH_REFRESH_TOKEN_KEY=pai_refresh_token
VITE_AUTH_TOKEN_EXPIRY_KEY=pai_token_expiry

VITE_ENABLE_ANALYTICS=false
VITE_ENABLE_DEBUG_MODE=false
VITE_ENABLE_MOCK_API=false

VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
VITE_APP_INSIGHTS_KEY=

VITE_ENV=production

If you want, I can also add a ready-to-use Azure App Settings checklist in both READMEs with these exact keys.